			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Scaffold Debug, ExtensionHostDebugService, and History handler modules\n\nAdd the crate-level module declaration files (mod.rs) with doc-only comments for three new WindServiceHandler subsystems: Debug, ExtensionHostDebugService, and History. Each module follows the established pattern of a dedicated subdirectory under Source/IPC/WindServiceHandlers/ with a module-level doc comment describing its handler domain.\n\nThese scaffolding modules serve as the structural foundation for upcoming handler implementations — Debug for general debugging commands, ExtensionHostDebugService for extension host debugging IPC, and History for navigational history commands — continuing the modularization pattern established by the recent SearchRouter consolidation.\n\nNo behavioural change; pure module infrastructure.",
