			"Message": "style(Mountain): Collapse CocoonManagement signatures and complete product ID rename\n\nCollapse multi-line expressions in three CocoonManagement files — `std::env::var` chain in BuildCocoonEnvironment.rs, function signature in LaunchAndManageCocoonSideCar.rs, and match-arm brace in SpawnRestartHandler.rs — continuing the formatting pass from recent commits.\n\nCarry the product identifier rename (`.fiddee` → `.fcd`) into the remaining default fallback values in InitializationData.rs: `nameShort`/`nameLong` default to `\"FCD\"`, `applicationName` to `\"fcd\"`, `embedderIdentifier` to `\"fcdd\"`, and `dataFolderName`/`sharedDataFolderName` to `\".fcd\"`. These are the default values when the corresponding env vars are unset.\n\nWrap the overlong `dev_log!` call in SpawnChannelReadPump.rs onto multiple lines to respect the 100-char line width.\n\nPure style and product-identifier defaults alignment — no behavioural change to environment construction, sidecar management, or channel handling.",
