			"Message": "style(Mountain): Apply formatting pass, add SearchRouter, rename dotfile\n\nCollapse multi-line function signatures, Tauri emit calls, and chained\nmethod chains to single lines across all 15 staged WindServiceHandler\nfiles. Add consistent blank-line separators between match arms in\nExtensionGetManifest, LocalPTYUpdateProperty, and KeybindingResolve.\nReflow dev_log! invocations and test assertions to respect 100-char\nline width in FileReadFd, FileWriteFd, PathExtraction,\nDeleteUntitledWorkspace, and EnterWorkspace.\n\nAdd the dedicated SearchRouter module\n(Source/IPC/WindServiceHandlers/Search/SearchRouter.rs) and register it\nin mod.rs, completing the search dispatch consolidation started in the\npreceding commit.\n\nRename the product dotfile from `.fiddee` to `.fcd` in FiddeeRoot.rs and\nupdate the allowed-protocol list in OpenExternal.rs to match, continuing\nthe product-identifier shortening pass.\n\nPure structural and cosmetic changes — no behavioural impact to search\nrouting, file I/O, keybinding resolution, or external URL opening.",
